---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/giving-brief-first-evening-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/giving-brief-first-evening-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Seven more commits in the 90 minutes after the first one"
  caption="The kit repo's git log for its first evening, 8 commits. Filled dots are fixes found by running it; squares are the read and write paths added for runs with nobody at the keyboard."
>
  Timeline of one evening's 8 commits. The first commit lands at 9:41 PM. A wording change follows at 9:51 PM. Two
  paths for headless runs land at 9:54 and 10:02 PM. Two permission fixes land at 10:25 and 10:56 PM. Two rules for
  unattended runs land at 11:07 and 11:11 PM.
</Chart>
